        "# Open problems: noise and moonquakes\n",
        "\n",
        "- Can we demonstrate active noise cancellation?\n",
        "- LGWA data will have gaps when moonquakes get too strong: how much do they impact PE?\n",
        "\n",
        "# Open problems: response calibration\n",
        "\n",
        "- We are assuming a known lunar response.\n",
        "- How does uncertainty there translate into parameter estimation?\n",
        "- Can we demonstrate the \"multibanding calibration trick\"?\n",
